OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786526313
OL,3,CHouseholds living near new pylons to
OL,4,Csave thousands on bills
OL,6,FThe government has unveiled the first
OL,7,Fwave of new pylons and grid
OL,8,Finfrastructure located in areas where
OL,9,Fhouseholds will be eligible for
OL,10,Fcheaper electricity bills.
OL,12,FThe Department for Energy Security and
OL,13,FNet Zero (Desnz) announced 43 projects
OL,14,Fexpected to be in the scope of its
OL,15,F"bills discount scheme" on Wednesday.
OL,26,@wD@AOUwD@WO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
