OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786526313
OL,3,CHouseholds living near new pylons to
OL,4,Csave thousands on bills
OL,6,FThe scheme will see those living
OL,7,Fwithin 500 metres of the new or
OL,8,Fupgraded overhead transmission lines
OL,9,Fand other eligible infrastructure
OL,10,Fstart to receive money off their bills
OL,11,Fin the first half of next year,
OL,12,Fofficials said.
OL,14,FDesnz said they could ultimately get
OL,15,F#2,500 off their electricity bills
OL,16,Fover 10 years through the discounts.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
