CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786526313
OL,3,CHouseholds living near new pylons to
OL,4,Csave thousands on bills
OL,6,FThe first wave of projects includes
OL,7,FNational Grid transmission
OL,8,Finfrastructure from Bramford to
OL,9,FTwinstead in East Anglia, the North
OL,10,FLondon Reinforcement project and the
OL,11,FEmmock substation in north-east
OL,12,FScotland.
OL,14,FA government impact assessment earlier
OL,15,Fthis year found that more than 100,000
OL,16,Fhouseholds could benefit from the
OL,17,Fscheme in the coming decades as
OL,18,Ffurther projects follow.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
