CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786526313
OL,3,CHouseholds living near new pylons to
OL,4,Csave thousands on bills
OL,6,FIt comes as the government pushes
OL,7,Fahead with upgrades to the country's
OL,8,Foutdated electricity grid, paving the
OL,9,Fway for new sources of clean
OL,10,Felectricity generation to connect to
OL,11,Fthe network, strengthening energy
OL,12,Fsecurity, reducing bills and tackling
OL,13,Fclimate change.
OL,15,FEnergy Minister Michael Shanks said:
OL,16,F"Upgrading Britain's electricity grid
OL,17,Fis a vital part of how we deliver
OL,18,Fsecure, homegrown energy and unlock
OL,19,Feconomic growth across the country.
OL,26,@xD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786526313
OL,3,CHouseholds living near new pylons to
OL,4,Csave thousands on bills
OL,6,F"It is a moment of national renewal `
OL,7,Fupgrading what was built largely in
OL,8,Fthe 1960s for the modern age and is
OL,9,Four route to bringing down electricity
OL,10,Fbills for households across the
OL,11,Fcountry.
OL,13,F"It's vital we build again as a
OL,14,Fcountry, and we are determined those
OL,15,Fcommunities which host pylons should
OL,16,Fbenefit, which is why we're bringing
OL,17,Fdown the energy bills of those hosting
OL,18,Fthis vital national infrastructure."
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOUzD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/14
