OL,3,CHouseholds living near new pylons to
OL,4,Csave thousands on bills
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FAlso among the first set of projects
OL,12,Fannounced on Wednesday are
OL,13,Ftransmission infrastructure from North
OL,14,FHumber to High Marnham in the Midlands
OL,15,Fand from Pentir to Trawsfynydd in
OL,16,Fnorth Wales, as well as the Coalburn,
OL,17,FMark Hill, Branxton and Sanquhar
OL,18,Fsubstations across Scotland.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/14
