CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786526313
OL,3,CHouseholds living near new pylons to
OL,4,Csave thousands on bills
OL,6,FMost households that qualify for the
OL,7,Fscheme will receive the discount
OL,8,Fautomatically on their electricity
OL,9,Fbill every six months via their energy
OL,10,Fsupplier, officials said, although
OL,11,Fsome may need to apply, such as those
OL,12,Fon commercial meters.
OL,14,FMinisters said they will be directly
OL,15,Fcontacted by their energy supplier or
OL,16,FOfgem with further information in the
OL,17,Ffirst half of 2027.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786526313
OL,3,CHouseholds living near new pylons to
OL,4,Csave thousands on bills
OL,6,FThese discounts build on the so-called
OL,7,F"community funds", where energy
OL,8,Fdevelopers have provided financial
OL,9,Fpackages to communities hosting new
OL,10,Finfrastructure since last year.
OL,12,FMinisters said that projects will only
OL,13,Fbe in scope for the discounts once
OL,14,Fthey have secured all necessary
OL,15,Fconsents and the main construction
OL,16,Fworks have started.
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@QO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
