OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786526313
OL,3,CHouseholds living near new pylons to
OL,4,Csave thousands on bills
OL,6,FOnly overground transmission projects,
OL,7,Fincluding substations, convertors,
OL,8,Fswitching stations, sealing-end
OL,9,Fcompounds and onshore converter
OL,10,Fstations for subsea power lines, will
OL,11,Fbe eligible if construction started on
OL,12,For after March 10 2025.
OL,14,FReform UK's deputy leader Richard Tice
OL,15,Fhas said the scheme "insults the
OL,16,Fintelligence" of British people and
OL,17,Fclaimed it is a "#20-a-month bribe for
OL,18,Ffamilies whose homes will be
OL,19,Fpermanently devalued".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786526313
OL,3,CHouseholds living near new pylons to
OL,4,Csave thousands on bills
OL,6,FTice, who is also the party's energy
OL,7,Fspokesperson, said that "new cables
OL,8,Fshould be placed underground where
OL,9,Fpossible instead of scarring our
OL,10,Flandscape".
OL,12,FThe party has promised to repeal the
OL,13,FClimate Change Act and to scrap the
OL,14,Fnet zero targets if they were in
OL,15,Fgovernment.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
