PN,30211
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786526313
OL,3,CHouseholds living near new pylons to
OL,4,Csave thousands on bills
OL,6,FOfgem executive director for delivery
OL,7,Fand schemes, Neil Lawrence, said:
OL,8,F"Communities that host new electricity
OL,9,Ftransmission infrastructure are
OL,10,Fplaying a vital role in delivering the
OL,11,Fcleaner, more secure energy system
OL,12,FBritain needs.
OL,14,F"The bill discount scheme will help
OL,15,Fensure eligible households living near
OL,16,Fthese projects see a direct benefit
OL,17,Fthrough discounts on their energy
OL,18,Fbills."
OL,26,@pD@AOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/14
