PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786526313
OL,3,CHouseholds living near new pylons to
OL,4,Csave thousands on bills
OL,6,FThe government is coming under growing
OL,7,Fpressure to tackle the soaring cost of
OL,8,Fliving and reduce the country's
OL,9,Fexposure to volatile global fossil
OL,10,Ffuel markets.
OL,12,FMinisters recently announced a VAT cut
OL,13,Fon electricity bills, but prime
OL,14,Fminister Andy Burnham is also facing a
OL,15,Fdilemma over whether to back new oil
OL,16,Fand gas drilling in the North Sea.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30213
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786526313
OL,3,CHouseholds living near new pylons to
OL,4,Csave thousands on bills
OL,6,FEnvironmental groups have urged the
OL,7,FPrime Minister to refuse permission
OL,8,Ffor oil and gas production in two
OL,9,Fareas of the North Sea, known as
OL,10,FJackdaw and Rosebank.
OL,12,FThey argue these projects will make
OL,13,Flittle impact on people's energy bills
OL,14,Fand go against efforts to tackle
OL,15,Fclimate change.
OL,17,FBut opposition politicians, the oil
OL,18,Fand gas industry and US President
OL,19,FDonald Trump have called for him to
OL,20,Fgrant permission, arguing this would
OL,21,Fcut bills and protect jobs.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
